"P3981929547" "You've spoken to Icedrone, but he refused to stop the protest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4220368028" "Take the fight to the Skulls in Hyperion Way"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3618531139" "Ugh, some people, I swear! He knows there are Skulls in Hyperion Way and he isn't doing anything about it?!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccessFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccessNoFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P945563305" "You defeated the Skulls and found a... recruitment flier?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBeginFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3122261544" "I can't believe this! The <i>Skulls</i> are trying to act like they're out to help everyone? {HeroName}, these guys are nothing but <color yellow>death worshipping, drug dealing thugs</color>!<br><br>I <i>don't</i> know who they're trying to fool, but <i>we</i> aren't going to let them get away with it.<br><br> I'll even help you take them on, I'll personally drag each of them over to the Zig if they think they can take advantage of Hyperion Way!<br><br>... Sorry. I just... things like this just make me <i>so</i> angry. Icedrone using the people for his agenda against the government... the Skulls using the people for <i>who</i> knows what. We need to do something about this!"
// RandomFameString :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Rosenfeld 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1121554514" "... A hero? What are you doing here?<br><br>Wait... you found my note? You're not seriously considering <i>joining</i> the Skulls, are you?"
// Answer Text :
"P451139781" "... No, I'm trying to get to the bottom of all this."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P776005374" "Oh. Whew. Well. This is perfect! I'm trying to do the same.<br><br>I think this is actually going to work out much better than I thought. I was going to convince whoever came here to get me information from inside that building, but with <i>you</i> here, I have a better idea."
// Answer Text :
"P3733956995" "What is it?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P794087225" "<color orange>Deborah Rosenfeld hands you a small device with a monitor on it.</color><br><br>I've got a small camera hidden on my jacket. I'd like for you to monitor me while I go inside of that building to get some answers.<br><br>If they start to get suspicious and come after me, I'm counting on you to come in and get me out! I figure with this, I can get you the information <i>you</i> need to stop the Skulls without them knowing about it!<br><br><color yellow>When you're ready, go into the nearby building and you can monitor my progress from there.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3190340675" "Alright, be careful in there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BoneDaddy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P596949864" "Hrmph, I recognize you. A reporter for the Paragon Times. What are you doing here?"
// Answer Text :
"P866961494" "I saw your recruitment fliers, I'm interested in joining with all of you."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1687265435" "Oh? So you see the family the Skulls has, do you?<br><br>Word must be spreading if we can even convince a high and mighty reporter to give up their job to come join us.<br><br>That, or things are even worse with the rich people here in Paragon."
// Answer Text :
"P273181597" "How can you provide for all of us? Are you robbing grocery stores for food?"
// Page Robbing Text :
"P2736215039" "Grocery stores? No, that's small time, lady. Now, I'm not going to blab on about what our <i>secrets</i> are.<br><br>Let's just say the Skulls have a... <i>bountiful</i> supply of food and water that we just happened to find.<br><br>If you want to help us out more, you can start spreading the word to the people in Hyperion who are trying to kick us out. You do that, and you got yourself a surefire ticket to our supply stash."
// Answer Text :
"P526416406" "... I'll see what I can do. Talk to you soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3269113110" "Something isn't right with the Skulls, {HeroName}, but it <i>is</i> starting to make sense. Let me explain.<br><br>Some of the people I've treated have said that they've been hearing of another way around all of this, that someone else is willing to take care of them. I also haven't seen those same people for a few days. I don't think it's a coincidence in the least.<br><br>They've probably gone off and joined the Skulls! But... as much as I <i>want</i> to hate them, I can't. They're being used, all they want is some safety and security, but the Skulls aren't going to be the ones to give it to them."
// AcceptString :
"P560908202" "We have to try to find out what else the Skulls are up to."
// SendOffString :
"P3148941246" "I agree! I don't think it's a coincidence either that the food supplies are going missing in all of this. I know this sounds jaded, but I think either the Skulls <i>or</i> Icedrone are behind this.<br><br>I <i>really</i> don't want to believe that Icedrone would put his own <i>political</i> agenda ahead of the needs of the people.<br><br>I've heard people saying that the Skulls have been directing possible candidates to a park nearby about places to meet. If you can go there and find the instructions, you should be able to track down exactly what they're doing!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P895939093" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Power of the Written Word</color>"

