"P4233178975" "Confront the Skull leader in the office complex"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P719245860" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Sondra Costel at this time.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P832296689" "Get out of the office complex"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1860948850" "<color orange>You must focus on finding out more information regarding the Skulls!</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccessFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccessNoFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4257942401" "You know, I never liked reporters until today. Deborah Rosenfeld is great! I'm relieved to know that it was the Skulls who were stealing the supplies and <i>not</i> Icedrone.<br><br>I think we're almost through this, {HeroName}. We just need to remember that there <i>is</i> a reason for all this,  that it's somehow for us, right? That's what I learned in the Galaxy Incident.<br><br><color yellow>Cygnus Hospital</color>, where I worked, was one of the first to be hit by the meteors. I would've been in there, if it wasn't for the fact that I had to take a walk to calm down after I lost one of my patients.<br><br>If that didn't happen... I wouldn't be here today. That's what I try to remember whenever these horrible things happen, that there has to be a way that this is for us, even if we <i>can't</i> see it. So let's see just how exactly this whole situation with the Skulls is going to work out!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - COSTEL3VAR 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P593213307" "Well, it's time to put my whole, 'this is all for a good reason' to the test. One of my friends just texted me that the Skulls are openly attacking people in Hyperion Way!<br><br>It seems like a group of people were trying to get together to warn everyone about the Skulls, they said <color yellow>Deborah Rosenfeld</color> was trying to get the word out about what they were doing.<br><br>The people of Hyperion Way need a hero, {HeroName}, someone to make a stand, to show the Skulls that they can't use them for their own ends!"
// AcceptString :
"P3379853691" "I'll make sure the Skulls don't get away with this, Sondra."
// SendOffString :
"P2188884268" "I knew you'd say that, {HeroName}! Maybe, you know, <i>maybe</i> this is why all of this is happening. Hyperion Way has always been a jaded place. They... <i>we</i> were hit hardest by the <color yellow>Hollowing</color>, when the nearby neighborhood of Eastgate was devastated.<br><br>We had to pick ourselves up and recover, almost all the efforts were going into fixing the neighborhood of Eastgate.<br><br>The people here tend to believe no one is going to help them, that you can only believe in yourself. Or worse, that people are just here to <i>use</i> them.<br><br>We're going to show them that there <i>is</i> someone looking out for them, that they <i>can</i> put their faith in other people, that there is someone out there who <i>isn't</i> trying to just use them!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1679277095" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: A Purpose To Follow</color>"

